{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Ashrei</b> — the meaning: for those who keep justice are the ones who recount the measure of His might." "And he mentioned the mighty deeds of HaShem — on account of His mighty deeds at the Sea of Reeds." "And the reason to mention justice — on account of the sins of Israel, and HaShem judged them according to their deeds."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 106, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:36.902084060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}